OL,3,GNEWSABurnham will not do 'special
OL,4,Ainterviews' with Sun newspaper
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has told the BBC he will
OL,7,Fnot do any "special interviews" with
OL,8,Fthe Sun newspaper and spoke of his
OL,9,F"responsibilities" to the Hillsborough
OL,10,Ffamilies.
OL,12,FThe prime minister said he would not go
OL,13,Finto his "precise media arrangements"
OL,14,Fafter being asked to confirm previous
OL,15,Freports that he was shunning the
OL,16,Ftabloid newspaper - but said his
OL,17,Fposition had been "confirmed".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
