OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABurnham will not do 'special
OL,4,Ainterviews' with Sun newspaper
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Sun has been widely boycotted on
OL,7,FMerseyside after the paper falsely
OL,8,Fblamed Liverpool fans for causing the
OL,9,F1989 stadium crush which killed 97
OL,10,Fpeople.
OL,12,FAs culture secretary, Burnham played a
OL,13,Fkey role in creating the Hillsborough
OL,14,FIndependent Panel which absolved fans
OL,15,Fof blame for the disaster in 2012.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
